      "value": "@{5ca74f3fb98a820b3ffec9cf|full_name}: can confirm it is not an app issue, rather an api issue. It is also not related to the display of slashes, but the filtering of them api-side after the recent api update which filters unicode characters. How recently did you update your bio?",
